  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This book was made in Y2K by mandy mastrovita at flit-gun press. It is comprised of old, greasy Vandercook tympans, handmade &amp; commerical papers, and bound together with bits of mixed media and ephemera/ crap laying around my home &amp; studio. I have tyewritten most of the text using an IBM Selectric typewriter (red) and have retained all typographic errors because they were all a better expression of the blips and mistakes that occur without editing in "real time." There is also a fair amount of appropriated text."--Colophon.</subfield>
